1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,353
Bu — ZAMIN FK stadionidagi bitta o‘rin.

2
00:00:03,373 --> 00:00:05,013
Va unda ism bor.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,619
Hozir bu tribunada bir ming uch yuz oltita ism bor.

4
00:00:08,639 --> 00:00:10,839
Har biri — haqiqiy obunachi.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,571
Ismingiz shu yerda.

6
00:00:13,591 --> 00:00:14,311
Toping.

7
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,002
Bu o‘rin esa hali bo‘sh.

8
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,609
Siz ham o‘z ismingizni qoldirmoqchimisiz?

9
00:00:30,629 --> 00:00:33,369
Obuna bo‘ling va izohga plyus qoldiring.

10
00:00:33,389 --> 00:00:35,549
O‘rningiz abadiy sizda qoladi.

